# @longtokens configures the lexer: it belongs in the @lexer section, not
# in the @parser section (nor before @lexer).
# error: longtokens_misplaced.grammar:14:1:
# error: @longtokens belongs in the @lexer section
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
@longtokens
top! = IDENT                                → (t 1)
